# Architecture guardrails seed allowlist (legacy matrix bootstrap)
#
# 格式: rule_id|path|reason|expires_at|legacy_entry_id|drop_phase
#   rule_id          WMS_INTEGRATION_BOUNDARY/EXECUTION_CORRELATION_BOUNDARY/AUTHORITY_METADATA_BOUNDARY/DEVICE_COMMAND_BOUNDARY/CAPABILITY_FORBIDDEN_DEPENDENCY/CAPABILITY_IMPLEMENTATION_IMPORT/INBOUND_NORMALIZER_OWNERSHIP
#   path             违规文件路径 (CAPABILITY_IMPLEMENTATION_IMPORT / INBOUND_NORMALIZER_OWNERSHIP 必须逐文件枚举)
#   reason           豁免原因
#   expires_at       过期日期 YYYY-MM-DD (无过期视为失败)
#   legacy_entry_id  关联 docs/architecture/legacy-cleanup-matrix.csv 的 entry_id
#   drop_phase       必须与 legacy-cleanup-matrix.csv 对应 entry 的 drop_phase 一致
#
# baseline validation: 所有 seed 条目引用存在的 legacy_entry_id, drop_phase 与 matrix 一致
# enforced mode: allowlist 之外违规阻塞 PR
# expiry-check mode: 过期 allowlist 阻塞 PR
#
# 删除任意一行后, --mode enforced 必须对对应历史违规返回非零 (证明 enforcement 生效)

